        },
        {
          "text": " nukolo kilosenenete kotoma, kwape ejaar epone loka akwapin kanu, kwape ejaar ekapolon loka apolou naka apak, emoyo loiswamakini kwana odwe luiulaka. ",
          "type": "text",
