        {
          "text": " Kanuka ŋun kiitunito ebe iraas kolo Imo kotoma akuan, luenyarito ŋul luenyarakina bonik luekepitai, lumam ekepitai, ŋes atemar ebe, akepio naka akuan nakiswamaete akanin,— ",
