            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kiitunito ebe kapak kaŋin amamei yes Kristo, igelara kajena naka Isirael, imo luamameete aitutuketa nuka aisumunet, amamei yes amun, amamei da yes Edeke kotoma akwapin. ",
          "type": "text",
